   "description": "Why this sample was rejected. Visible from Pending Approval onwards, not from Rejected: frappe.model.workflow.apply_workflow calls doc.load_from_db() before acting, so the reason has to be SAVED before Reject is pressed. Shown only once the state is Rejected, the reviewer could never fill it in - the field would appear only after the transition it is required by had already been refused. Mandatory still keys on Rejected alone, so approving needs nothing. allow_on_submit because Rejected is a doc_status=1 state.",
